              "heading": "Unified Payments Interface (UPI) – ZX Bank Asia"
            },
            "text": "Unified Payments Interface (UPI) is a real-time payment system that enables instant money transfer between bank accounts using your mobile device. ZX Bank Asia supports UPI seamlessly through its mobile app for fast, secure, and convenient transactions."
          }
        ],
